# Opening balance

Assets:Checking

Enter the balance at the end of the day before the first transaction you will import. Imported rows dated on or before this date would be counted twice.

For example: if the first statement you will import starts on 2026-10-01, enter the balance at the end of 2026-09-30.

Date
[ 2026-09-30______________ ]
  Not after today, 2026-11-16.

Balance
[ -35.20__________________ ]
  What the account held at the end of that day.
  ! The opening balance was not saved because the amount has a minus and the box under it is ticked, and one of the two is enough: each makes the amount less than nothing. Take away the minus or untick the box, then save again.

[x] The account was overdrawn (it held less than nothing)

